+ * The CPU path below runs the program on every distinct vertex, clips at the
+ * near plane and culls, and hands the back end finished vertices. Here the
+ * back end is handed the batch as the title left it -- the program, the
+ * constants, the attribute arrays and a triangle list -- and its GPU does all
+ * of that, clipping included, by the rules Nv2aProgramDraw lists. What is
+ * left on this thread is a pass over the indices and the copy of the arrays.
